{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_absin_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_absin_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"向死尋生","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_absin_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"902599d64472da159a225a3dc63b533b5fdfecc6d928b3bf8d0e5126c20e4c31","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"地下廢墟"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這裡是羅德島幹員……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……重複，這裡是羅德島幹員苦艾與幹員……早露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"約兩個小時三十分鐘前，我們於烏薩斯邊境天災疏散任務中與隊伍失散，陷入一處塌方形成的地下空洞……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……目前暫時沒有人員傷亡。最後的位置座標……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到請回覆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，還是聯絡不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我得再換個位置——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——你怎麼站起來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該坐下來好好休息，你的腿……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你離開了三十分鐘，有什麼發現嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……很遺憾，沒有能幫助我們離開這裡的發現呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你說的沒錯，裡面的確是一個自然形成的溶洞，但透光處位於更深處的正上方，而不是直線盡頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"無法沿著洞穴離開，頭頂的透光處又過高，沒有外部援助，我們很難出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來和這裡的情況差不多。我知道了，謝謝你的確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不如說，反而是我應該謝謝你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，苦艾小姐，你感覺好一點了嗎？你的傷口怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我在後勤部門的時候，學過有限條件下的急救措施，可以再幫你檢查一下止血情況，然後換藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不要急著拒絕我。你為了救我受傷，又帶著我避開了後續的餘震。這都是我應該做的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……東側已經疏散完畢，確認沒有居民了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山腳的最後一戶也已經安全轉移。時間不夠了，我們需要儘快撤離，否則天災——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"苦艾小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抓住我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"腿部傳來的劇痛使苦艾的聲音變得扭曲。但她很快將哀嚎聲壓低，隱忍不發，強行將注意力轉移到周圍。\n在這深不見底的黑暗中，她一無所獲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……看不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後一定還有餘震，得快點轉移位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——光棒不在我這裡。早……娜塔莉婭！你能聽見我說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭？"},{"type":"narration","text":"她伸出手去，交握的掌心仍然溫熱，所幸兩人並未因墜落而徹底分散開來。\n但此刻另一隻手的主人卻毫無回音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……昏迷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有血腥味，黏稠……她頭上好像也出血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頭部出血……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得先轉移位置，最好有些光線才能看清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕敲斷壁）"},{"type":"narration","text":"斷壁橫樑帶出一陣空洞的迴響，驅散頭腦中的混沌。閉眼後再睜眼，她的視野逐漸清晰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……來吧，來吧。至少給我一個更安全的方向。"},{"type":"narration","text":"苦艾攙扶起昏迷的同伴，向隱約有光的地方移動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是做了我應該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換成羅德島的其他任何人，他們也都會這樣做。帶著同伴，找到結構更穩定的地下空間，爭取救援時間……固定流程而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且就像你頭上的傷一樣，我的腿傷也不嚴重，都是外傷，已經止血，也沒有骨頭錯位需要調整，急救派不上用場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用太在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那……通訊器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是無法聯絡外界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且因為裡面儲存的能源剩得不多，我們不能一直保持開機狀態，等待訊號被捕捉，只能間隔一段時間再嘗試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那我現在還能做些什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前暫時只能先等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想問什麼，可以直接問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"有這麼明顯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我是想問我們最後疏散的、住在山腳下的那對母子，他們是不是真的安全撤離了？因為地震來得很突然……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果真的聯絡不上外界，到時候我們該怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，在和你會合之前，我確認過那對母子已經疏散到安全地帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，如果主動聯絡失敗，等他們清點人數時發現我們缺席，也會派人出來尋找的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都在標準流程中，就像我之前救你一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你總是這麼可靠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你很可靠，好像沒有什麼困境能擊潰你。現在如果只有我一個人在這裡，我一定不知道該怎麼辦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在切爾諾伯格——在那種地方，當事故發生，如果你真的不知道應該做什麼，又怎麼能從那裡活著離開呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更不要說現在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我總是忘記你也是從切城……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。為了活下去，我做過一些事，但也得到了許多幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我更不明白之前你為什麼要選擇折返。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明可以安全離開，卻選擇回來和我們一起繼續疏散不願離開的村民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有救援任務經驗的幹員就該在天災來臨前跟隨大部隊一起返回，而不是留下來。萬一我之前沒能救下你，或者這次我們真的沒能出去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你之前那些為了活下來而做的努力就全都白費了，幫助過你的人，他們的努力也都白費了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"道理是這樣，沒錯。可是如果每次我都不選擇留下，那我永遠都會是那個沒有經驗的新人，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"永遠原地踏步，永遠幫助不了更多的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想像你們一樣，能做更多……這也是為什麼我選擇從後勤轉到前線來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這些理由不能改變你在沒有足夠能力的前提下，主動選擇了“危險”這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你其實並不把自己的性命當成什麼重要的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）真不知道，那些幫過你，甚至為此丟了性命的人……會怎麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你有話沒有說完。為什麼不說完呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，這本來也不關我的事，是我多話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經間隔一段時間了，我換個位置，調整一下通訊器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是羅德島幹員苦艾與幹員早露，重複，這裡是羅德島幹員……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"也許再舉高一些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在嘗試——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷續的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——探測儀——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷續的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——嗞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？這裡是羅德島幹員苦艾與幹員早露！我們於烏薩斯邊境天災疏散任務中與隊伍失散，陷入一處塌方形成的地下空洞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們最後的位置座標——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷續的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——嗞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？請問能聽到嗎？我們最後的座標是61.700.20.450——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，好不容易……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但既然能收到通訊，就說明這附近有其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我拿著通訊器去洞穴裡試試吧，說不定在透光處下面，通訊狀況會更好呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洞穴……那我們一起過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你的傷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過了，沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這種情況下，我們本來就更應該一起行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那我來攙扶你吧，總能節省一些力氣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"苦艾輕輕搖頭，避開了那隻向她伸來的手。\n眼前人的力氣足夠舉起巨大的攻城器械，自然也足夠攙扶一位體重偏輕的傷者。\n在她的幫助下前進應該是此刻最合適的選擇，可是不知為何，苦艾就是不願這樣做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……在這邊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我沿著邊緣尋找，想看看有沒有通道的時候，發現了這個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"看，一個不大不小的石頭，站上去雖然能離頭頂的光源更近一點，但對觸摸到透光處來說還差得遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"總之請稍等，等我爬上去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小心——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"——好了！請把通訊器遞給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……座標記住了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"記住了，很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不過……咦？這個要在哪裡打開呢？好像和之前我用過的通訊器有點不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉，這是我自己改裝的通訊器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頻段我已經調好了，你按下側面的長方形按鈕開機。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隱約的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——嗞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"有聲音！這算不算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"訊號被接收了，和剛才一樣，按照我教給你的彙報就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是羅德島幹員苦艾與幹員早露，我們於烏薩斯邊境天災疏散任務中與隊伍失散，陷入一處塌方形成的地下空洞……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"最後位置座標為61.700.20.450。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"重複，最後位置座標為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——喂？——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能聽到嗎？這裡是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——天災信使——喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回覆說能聽到，然後重複座標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能聽到！這裡是羅德島幹員苦艾與幹員早露，我們需要支援，最後位置座標為61.700.20.450！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——收到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請在原地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——等——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我——抱歉，我沒聽清他最後說了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要成功傳回了座標，就成功了一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我們就先回原來的地方吧。那裡結構相對穩定，之前兩次餘震都沒有受到多少影響，更安全，也更適合等待救援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊又中斷了，天災應該還沒有完全過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在最重要的，是在救援人員到達之前，保證自己的安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按時間來說應該就快到了，我在最開始停留的地方做了記號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看見一塊紅色的布料了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有看見。不過我這裡還有兩根光棒，用它們來照明吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我一根。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，還是先留著吧。我們不知道救援人員具體的到達時間，不要把物資提前用光了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我記得應該就在這附近……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——是餘震！該死——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"苦艾小姐，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別過來！蹲下，然後用手抱住頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照我說的做！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坍塌不嚴重，但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光源被擋住了，鋼管和橫樑應該沒有繼續斷裂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭，你怎麼樣了？能聽見我說話嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"回答她的只有灰塵不斷落下的動靜，和逐漸沉重的呼吸聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿、嘿，我聽見了。來，把手給我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你拿著光棒，正好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗚……啊……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，你抖得好厲害，你傷到哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能幫你——呃——救援人員就快到了，你再撐一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"——殺了我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"直接殺了我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因為——是因為太痛了嗎？你為什麼會這樣說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我請求您……幫幫我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得知道你傷到哪裡才能幫忙，但你一直在躲開我，這樣我沒有辦法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚、嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我……不……不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我請求您，我請求您……不要把我留在這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會把你留在這裡，我不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，告訴我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你什麼也不告訴我，那我要怎麼幫你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不清楚。我看不見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼也看不見……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你看不見？難道你的眼睛受傷了？還是頭部受傷，淤血壓迫了神經？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你保持不動，我得看看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼睛看上去沒有聚焦，頭上似乎沒有新的傷口……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有哪裡受傷了嗎？是什麼讓你痛成這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢一點，儘量清楚地告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不行……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行？為什麼不行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"看看，我都在說些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"您還是殺了我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……殺了我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟為什麼一直要說這種話？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們先前——我們先前在這裡說過的那些，都是不存在的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說你想活下來，想幫助更多的人，那也都只是冠冕堂皇的假話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"——是啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您殺了我吧！就像您放了那把火一樣殺了我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"與其讓我這樣苟活，倒不如讓我痛快地死去，就像我害死的那些人，他們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不會要我活著。您也不需要我活著，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"只需要用您的那柄斧頭，對著這裡來上一下……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"就像這樣，很快的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我只有這一個請求……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這也不可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你究竟是怎麼了，但我聽見了你說的話。而我不能對這些話坐視不理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你的命不是你一個人的，就像我的也不是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的命屬於那些被永遠留下的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……求你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死在切城的人太多了。你有沒有讀過事後的報告？我讀過，就算我怎麼也數不清遇難者名單上那些小小的名字，也還是一遍遍地去數……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想找到瓦列里叔叔的名字，找到……找到我父親的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他去過彼得海姆，然後把命丟在了那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道那裡當時到底發生過什麼，我只能猜測，然後不斷地觀察你們這些從彼得海姆來的倖存者，試圖得到一個答案，關於……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……誰在說……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於我父親的犧牲究竟換來了什麼，在你們身上，到底有什麼值得他犧牲的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，我必須知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我沒有答案！我一直都沒有找到——所以我本來都打算不去想了，直到你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到你突然從後勤轉到前線，出現在這樣的任務裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你向前走了。你有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你並沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"殺了我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了！我不會殺你！既然做出了選擇，那你憑什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你憑什麼不好好珍惜自己的生命？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……求你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你實在想死，可以。等我們從這裡出去，等到沒人注意的時候，你有無數種方法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"殺了我吧，索尼婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——隨便你……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"就只是，殺了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不要、不要讓我活著留在這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，什麼也沒有啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……“索尼婭”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是我的名字，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認為自己現在在哪裡？在切城嗎？在彼得海姆嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你……並沒有從創傷中恢復，又為什麼要申請成為前線幹員，為什麼要以身涉險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道預料不到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣狼狽的時刻嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……我在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"學校的餐廳……是這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不、我記不起來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經不在切城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那我在哪裡？你又是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在正在地下某處，我是羅德島幹員苦艾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"地下。為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……因為你想救更多的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，我們要找到走出去的方法。如果你能聽見我說話，就閉上眼睛，跟著我，深呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我帶你走出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼樣了？你感覺還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呃、苦艾小姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我這是……怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……我怎麼哭了？真不好意思……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，只是耽誤了一些時間。我們得再試試聯絡外界了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是羅德島幹員苦艾與幹員早露，最後位置座標為61.700.20.450。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重複，這裡是羅德島幹員苦艾與幹員早露——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦？好像有頻段接入了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂——喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是羅德島災後搜救小隊，請直接報上座標——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……接上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後位置座標為61.700.20.450，建議搜尋西側塌陷地塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這裡有兩個人，狀態……尚可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜……早露，請按照之前我說的節奏敲響你身邊的鋼管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"兩輕一重……是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坐標是之前收到過的那個，求救訊號……紅外探測儀顯示——好、好近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——喂？還能聽到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果能聽見，就用剛才的頻率敲擊鋼管，回應我們——"},{"type":"narration","text":"搜救隊伍到了。\n苦艾向著聲音傳來的上方抬起頭，早露則再次敲響身邊最近的鋼管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人！下面有人！就在我們收到的座標附近，應該就是她們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稍等，我們馬上開展救援，請待在原地，不要隨意移動……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到請敲一下鋼管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（敲一下鋼管）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請稍等——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上有傷，等一下你先上去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身體狀況更好一些，沒問題的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g15_eveningglow_L2"},{"type":"narration","text":"儘管早就知道劫後餘生的喜悅並不如書本中描述的那樣強烈，苦艾還是感到一陣恍然。\n在雲朵仿若火焰一樣鋪開的天空之下，她深深地、像呼吸一樣感受著這陣轉瞬即逝的情緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……幹員苦艾狀態確認，初步判斷為輕傷，已成功獲救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請先在一旁休息，不要劇烈運動，等幹員早露也被營救上來之後，我會馬上幫你重新處理小腿傷口——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——幹員苦艾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來幫忙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？你還是別動——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……咦？苦艾小姐，你的傷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼要緊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把手給我吧，我會拉你上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員早露。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_197_poca","aliases":["早露"]}]}
